 "notes": [
  "Written 2026-10-30 from the build's own definitions (runs/a24/zflx/r3/exec: ui_flow_0e9f34a7\u2026json.md via tools/a24_map_helper.py, workflow_*.md, system_*.md, data_types.txt) and, for the END payload, the scripts' own comments plus the build's configure_end_node calls (payload ${ui} in all four workflows). Written before any workflow of the build was run and before any output was opened. Fixes 1-6 apply.",
  "UI flow: one page (CardDemoPage) whose panels are shown by ${screen}: signon, menu, adminMenu, acctSearch, acctDetail, billPay, goodbye. The map reads the ${ui} paths the page reads (screen, session, signon.*, menu.*, acctView.*, acct.*, cust.*, bill.*).",
  "Start: the page opens on the sign-on panel through a UI_EVENT (initSignon), no workflow; CC00 and CB00 both open on COSGN0A.",
  "Two legacy AIDs are page-only UI_EVENTs with no workflow: PF3 on sign-on (goodbye panel with the literal 'Thank you for using CardDemo application...') and PF4 on bill payment (clears the fields and the message). Mapped as actions with no workflow.",
  "Session: every workflow returns ui.session (null on sign-on failures and after exit); the map carries it from every response and passes it back, as the page does. The menu pre-fills acctView.accountId and bill.accountId from session.accountId; the map shows those as ACCTSID / ACTIDIN on the next screen.",
  "Bill payment: one message value (bill.message) shown by two texts by messageType (error; info/success): ERRMSG <- bill.message (fix 6 is not needed).",
  "Account view: the details panel is one text block; each single value in it is mapped to its legacy field. Not mapped (combined on the page, missing): ACRCYCR/ACRCYDB, ACSFNAM/ACSMNAM/ACSLNAM, ACSADL1/ACSADL2/ACSCITY/ACSSTTE/ACSCTRY/ACSZIPC, ACSPHN1/ACSPHN2, ACSEFTC/ACSPFLG; ACSGOVT (not on the page), INFOMSG (no info line). ENTER maps to Search; the details panel has no Search button (the browser subset checks the page).",
  "Menu: OPTN001-OPTN010 are the lines of the constant text MenuOptions1to10; OPTN011 is hidden while the pending-authorization toggle is false.",
  "Stores: CONTRACT-UI names and types, identity field map; partition key _id. The build left no loader workflows: operator loaders via make-loader.",
  "Not reachable (no button): PF5 everywhere; PF4 except on bill payment."
 ],
